  "goodToKnow": "Weiterführend means further or continuing: weiterführende Informationen, weiterführende Literatur (further reading). Die weiterführende Schule is secondary school: after four years of Grundschule (six in Berlin and Brandenburg), pupils move to a Gymnasium, Realschule, Gesamtschule or other type, a decision made at about age ten that is much debated. The verb weiterführen means to continue."
